[E-NOT-A-TYPE] Error: expected a type
   ╭─[ reject/and-bool-in-prop.sw:4:49 ]
   │
 4 │ def f (b: Bool) (x: Nat): Nat := if h: x < 3 && b then 1 else 0
   │                                                 ┬  
   │                                                 ╰── this has type `Bool`, so it isn't a type
   │ 
   │ Note 1: `&&` here is on propositions; for a `Bool` `b`, the proposition that it's true is `b = True`
   │ 
   │ Note 2: `if h: P` needs a proposition `P`; for a `Bool`, write `if c then … else …`
───╯
